OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,7,Fnorth in the morning. Further showery
OL,8,Frain in the afternoon, persistent in
OL,9,Fplaces and occasionally heavy with a
OL,10,Fchance of lightning.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FUnsettled on Wednesday with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,15,FRain clears Thursday morning, then
OL,16,Fdrier and brighter. Showery rain from
OL,17,Fthe west on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
